9
00:00:42,959 --> 00:00:46,923
Toggle View As between Campaign owner and Messaging lead

10
00:00:46,923 --> 00:00:51,029
to isolate overrides, quiet-hour blocks, and paused sends.

11
00:00:51,829 --> 00:00:57,107
In Pinning, scheduling an SMS at twelve-ten UTC flags the six-ten

12
